## 4. 后端关键文件快照

### 4.1 backend/pyproject.toml

```toml
[build-system]
requires = ["setuptools>=68", "wheel"]
build-backend = "setuptools.build_meta"

[project]
name = "personal-knowledge-radar"
version = "0.1.4"
description = "Local-first personal knowledge base assistant with user-controlled smart capture profiles, optional Scrapling stealthy ingestion, and visual UI."
requires-python = ">=3.10"
dependencies = [
  "typer>=0.12",
  "rich>=13.7",
  "fastapi>=0.115",
  "uvicorn>=0.30",
  "pydantic>=2.7",
  "markdownify>=0.13",
  "orjson>=3.10",
  "httpx>=0.27",
  "python-dotenv>=1.0",
]

[project.optional-dependencies]
web = ["scrapling[ai]"]
ui = ["streamlit>=1.38", "pandas>=2.2"]
local-ai = ["ollama>=0.3"]
dev = ["pytest>=8", "ruff>=0.5", "mypy>=1.10"]
all = ["scrapling[ai]", "streamlit>=1.38", "pandas>=2.2", "ollama>=0.3"]

[project.scripts]
pkr = "pk_radar.main:app"

[tool.setuptools.packages.find]
where = ["src"]

[tool.ruff]
line-length = 100
```

### 已知问题

实际包在 `backend/pk_radar/`，不是 `backend/src/pk_radar/`。所以 `where = ["src"]` 很可能导致 `pip install -e` 后找不到包。第一优先级要修。

推荐改法：

```toml
[tool.setuptools.packages.find]
where = ["."]
include = ["pk_radar*"]
```

或者迁移为标准 src 结构。

---

### 4.2 backend/pk_radar/config.py

```python
from __future__ import annotations

import os
from dataclasses import dataclass
from pathlib import Path

@dataclass(frozen=True)
class Settings:
    db_path: Path = Path(os.getenv("PKR_DB_PATH", "./data/knowledge.db"))
    storage_dir: Path = Path(os.getenv("PKR_STORAGE_DIR", "./data/storage"))
    default_fetch_mode: str = os.getenv("PKR_DEFAULT_FETCH_MODE", "auto")
    ollama_base_url: str = os.getenv("PKR_OLLAMA_BASE_URL", "http://127.0.0.1:11434")
    ollama_model: str = os.getenv("PKR_OLLAMA_MODEL", "deepseek-r1:8b")

def get_settings() -> Settings:
    settings = Settings()
    settings.db_path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
    settings.storage_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
    return settings
```

